## 2️⃣ Solution Overview

### 🎯 Strategy: 3 sequential bump waves, all on the root `yarn.lock` of `normainofficial/normain`

Most fixes are transitive. Use `yarn up <pkg>@<ver>` (or `resolutions` in root `package.json`) — direct deps live in workspace packages, so prefer `resolutions` for transitives, `yarn up -R` for direct.

### 🌊 Wave 1 — Cross-cohort bumps (clear Critical + overdue High while killing Medium dupes)
**🗓️ Target: this week (before May 5)** — also makes the May-18 Critical SLA.

| Order | 🔧 Action | ✅ Closes |
|---|---|---|
| 1️⃣ | `axios` → 1.15.0 | 1 🔴 Critical + 1 🟡 Medium |
| 2️⃣ | `vite` → 6.4.2 | 1 🟠 High + 2 🟡 Medium + 2 🟢 Low |
| 3️⃣ | `lodash` → 4.18.0 | 1 🟠 High + 2 🟡 Medium |
| 4️⃣ | `path-to-regexp` → 8.4.0 | 1 🟠 High + 1 🟡 Medium |
| 5️⃣ | `picomatch` → 2.3.2 & 4.0.4 (resolutions both ranges) | 1 🟠 High + 2 🟡 Medium |
| 6️⃣ | `qs` → 6.14.2 | 1 🟡 Medium + 1 🟢 Low |

⏱️ Effort: ~½ day. Single PR. CI runs catch breakage.

### 🌊 Wave 2 — High-multiplicity Medium-only bumps
**🗓️ Target: next week (May 5–12).** Each is a one-line bump, big alert reduction.

| 🔧 Action | ✅ Closes |
|---|---|
| `dompurify` → 3.4.0 (resolution) | 8 🟡 Medium |
| `hono` → 4.12.14 (direct in worker; `yarn up -R hono`) | 7 🟡 Medium |
| `@fastify/static` → 9.1.1 (direct in `server/api`) | 4 🟡 Medium (2 GHSA) |
| `langsmith` → 0.5.19 | 2 🟡 Medium |
| `@anthropic-ai/sdk` → 0.81.0 (direct in `server/worker`) | 2 🟡 Medium |

⏱️ Effort: ~1 day. Hono major-line is stable; verify route/middleware compat. Anthropic SDK 0.79→0.81 may shift types.

### 🌊 Wave 3 — Singletons (mop-up)
**🗓️ Target: May 12–22.** All low-risk transitive bumps, batch into one PR.

@hono/node-server, ajv, brace-expansion, esbuild, fast-xml-parser, follow-redirects, markdown-it, mdast-util-to-hast, postcss, **uuid (defer — major bump, separate PR with API audit)**.

⏱️ Effort: ~½ day for the 9 transitives; **uuid 14.0.0 = separate ½-day spike** (API surface review).

